    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cybersim: Noetic City is a half cozy, casual room builder, where players have the freedom to relax with a casual room builder in creative mode or play strategically as a Hacker with a custom deck of hacking programs in casual and normal mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a newly appointed agent of the Special Cyberwarfare Service. You are responsible for taking down networks used by criminals in the city through a collection of various hacking programs. Use credits to furnish your home and buy upgrades for your hardware and software, to further enhance you hacking capabilities. Create a powerful deck and become a top tier hacker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Our Discord</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase your decor and have it delivered to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your personal computer to purchase all your customizable furniture and decor for your apartment. Create the perfect cyberpunk space, just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/20a7c21b2e9453611443e76690712383.poster.avif?t=1750249975\" width=646 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/20a7c21b2e9453611443e76690712383.webm?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/20a7c21b2e9453611443e76690712383.mp4?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional Decor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable options can be found across many items purchased from your computer. Apartment controls, TV channels, radio stations, lights and monitors. You have control to make your place one of a kind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/1f5724df35e1997d671ea9ac04133341.poster.avif?t=1750249975\" width=646 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/1f5724df35e1997d671ea9ac04133341.webm?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/1f5724df35e1997d671ea9ac04133341.mp4?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let there be light</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have complete control of your lighting color and intensity, to help create the perfect mood. Control anything from individually placed lights to room ceiling lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/77042c46caae2ed62ae2ec0a3a5cf6ad.poster.avif?t=1750249975\" width=646 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/77042c46caae2ed62ae2ec0a3a5cf6ad.webm?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/77042c46caae2ed62ae2ec0a3a5cf6ad.mp4?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberwarfare and Hacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your drone around the city and perform hacks at various locations, that are hubs for criminal networks. Use hacking protocols in your deck to take down networks in the city. Upgrade hacks and purchase performance kits to enhance your hacking capabilities. Earn credits through successful hacks and purchase decor for your apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/552b0dd262379ef49ba4830230a8b0e5.avif?t=1750249975\" width=800 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode (Cozy Mode)</strong> <br>If you don't want to dive into the hacking, no problem. We have a creative mode to satisfy all your room decorating needs with no stress at all. Just select what you want and have it shipped to your apartment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Please keep in mind that this is a small game. We are two devs with a love for cyberpunk and we want share a small slice of that love with everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cybersim: Noetic City is a half cozy, casual room builder, where players have the freedom to relax with a casual room builder in creative mode or play strategically as a Hacker with a custom deck of hacking programs in casual and normal mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a newly appointed agent of the Special Cyberwarfare Service. You are responsible for taking down networks used by criminals in the city through a collection of various hacking programs. Use credits to furnish your home and buy upgrades for your hardware and software, to further enhance you hacking capabilities. Create a powerful deck and become a top tier hacker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Our Discord</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase your decor and have it delivered to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your personal computer to purchase all your customizable furniture and decor for your apartment. Create the perfect cyberpunk space, just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/20a7c21b2e9453611443e76690712383.poster.avif?t=1750249975\" width=646 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/20a7c21b2e9453611443e76690712383.webm?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/20a7c21b2e9453611443e76690712383.mp4?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional Decor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactable options can be found across many items purchased from your computer. Apartment controls, TV channels, radio stations, lights and monitors. You have control to make your place one of a kind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/1f5724df35e1997d671ea9ac04133341.poster.avif?t=1750249975\" width=646 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/1f5724df35e1997d671ea9ac04133341.webm?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/1f5724df35e1997d671ea9ac04133341.mp4?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let there be light</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have complete control of your lighting color and intensity, to help create the perfect mood. Control anything from individually placed lights to room ceiling lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/77042c46caae2ed62ae2ec0a3a5cf6ad.poster.avif?t=1750249975\" width=646 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/77042c46caae2ed62ae2ec0a3a5cf6ad.webm?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/77042c46caae2ed62ae2ec0a3a5cf6ad.mp4?t=1750249975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberwarfare and Hacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your drone around the city and perform hacks at various locations, that are hubs for criminal networks. Use hacking protocols in your deck to take down networks in the city. Upgrade hacks and purchase performance kits to enhance your hacking capabilities. Earn credits through successful hacks and purchase decor for your apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461600/extras/552b0dd262379ef49ba4830230a8b0e5.avif?t=1750249975\" width=800 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode (Cozy Mode)</strong> <br>If you don't want to dive into the hacking, no problem. We have a creative mode to satisfy all your room decorating needs with no stress at all. Just select what you want and have it shipped to your apartment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Please keep in mind that this is a small game. We are two devs with a love for cyberpunk and we want share a small slice of that love with everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
